  (text "120 V MAINS: heater power path and latching limit circuit"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 25.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "6dd982aa-f0aa-5220-9e63-2d54accb8c8c")
  )
  (text "LOW VOLTAGE: 12 V, 5 V and 3.3 V. ESP32 pins per firmware/README.md"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 20.32 127 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "a32ef357-e230-5961-b0d5-155ee9b7320d")
  )
  (text "THERMOCOUPLES: T1, T3 to T6 on the ESP32; T2 on U2 only"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 76.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "f09898da-fed9-5223-afd2-0449b9184afc")
  )
  (text "Notes"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 20.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "ef13fbd5-6dda-52f9-ad41-43bb5dd409d5")
  )
  (text "1. Cord to F1 in 14 AWG; all 120 V wiring after F1 in 16 AWG minimum, rated 105 C."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 25.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "faa3af37-55d8-50a8-b46c-088c420d6e8f")
  )
  (text "2. Heaters run only with K1 latched: START pressed, STOP closed, U2 relay closed (T2 < 600 C)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 29.21 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "4f88d35a-fd15-57cf-b6c6-396ee79611ee")
  )
  (text "3. Any trip, STOP or power loss drops K1; it stays open until START is pressed."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 33.02 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "81dbe4e8-ddf7-5821-83f5-f5030c3c7276")
  )
  (text "4. U2: on-off heating action, setpoint 600 C; relay closed below setpoint, open unpowered."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 36.83 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "036b5d32-b9d8-58b7-98dc-24a1f95e3fc6")
  )
  (text "5. R1 holds the SSR off through ESP32 boot and reset. If the SSR LED is dim at 3.3 V,"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 40.64 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "e5bf7285-0582-596a-92ce-af18982fced8")
  )
  (text "   drive U1 from +5V through an NPN (2N3904, 1k base resistor); keep R1."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 44.45 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "604f16f5-09c9-511c-acb9-fc340f9628f0")
  )
  (text "6. Bond to PE: drum, wells, jacket, stack, enclosure, junction box, SSR heat sink."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 48.26 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "18b1e149-9039-5e18-867f-0b5e380e43c9")
  )
  (text "7. K1, U1 and U2 terminal numbers are functional; follow each part's wiring label."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 52.07 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "55d0d6c6-4a73-50bc-8e5c-ac2877987041")
  )
  (text "8. T2 goes only to U2, never to the ESP32, so the limit stays independent."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 55.88 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "3a33427d-d303-5c9d-86ca-0d27c7854ae5")
  )
  (text "9. PS1 and K1 mount on the DIN rail; layout in enclosure drawing TBK-DWG-005."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 254 59.69 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "033079dc-650d-5218-8677-9e06e315c6e3")
  )
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "1")
    )
  )
